listing:   tshark on stick.pcap of the forensic run
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r stick.pcap -Y usbms.dCBWSignature -T fields -e frame.number -e usbms.dCBWTag -e scsi_sbc.opcode -e scsi_sbc.rdwr10.lba -e scsi_sbc.rdwr10.xferlen
date:      2026-10-09T22:39:36Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
